  "scope": "M5 historical sampled3stores and Retail are development. Dominicks reserved targets296..399 external confirmation under this lock. M5 weekly bridge is same enterprise,36additional deployments; not another data source.",
  "cohort": "M5 hash1000 per store; Retail all1692; Dominicks500 per prespecified category,store-round-robin hash; eligibility only past. No future survival. Explicit OK1 zeros retained, missing/OK0 are NaN. H labels require every target unit observed; all methods identical finite target mask.",
  "model": "Identical log normalized lag, rolling mean/std/frequency/observation-count, calendar and onehot store/category features. Scales and frequency groups fixed using initial history. Targets divided by fixed mean H historical demand floor1. No future price/promotion. LGBM separate .90/.95; MLP joint2heads softplus. finite historical validation selects256/512 rounds or64/128 width x5/10/20 epochs,firstseed only; then fixed for all3seeds.",
  "calendar": "Initial fit at initial_cutoff, warmup issue initial+1. All U first update eval_start, before forecast; candidate fitting uses targets ending<=cutoff. Bank at minimumU shared for all coarser calendars; never use candidate predictions before fit. Refit independently from scratch; no online SGD inheritance.",
  "methods": {
    "R0": "Clip nonnegative and sort raw model slots; common raw reference b_s for all calibrators.",
    "R1": "Global rolling empirical residual quantile, reuse old mature residuals.",
    "R2": "Frequency-group rolling residual quantile, reuse all mature feedback.",
